    {
      "id": 1,
      "text": "Mount Airy was founded in 1874 when a railroad station was built at the highest point between New Orleans and New York.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        2
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.townofmtairy.com/history",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The town’s first federal building, erected in 1903, later served as the municipal office, courthouse, and library.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        1
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.wonderfulmuseums.com/museum/mount-airy-museum-of-regional-history/",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "After renovations that began in 2014, the historic 1903 building became the City Hall in 2016.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        11
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.townofmtairy.com/history",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Mount Airy Museum of Regional History occupies a historic downtown building that itself tells a story of the town’s past.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        17
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.wonderfulmuseums.com/museum/mount-airy-museum-of-regional-history/",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Mount Airy’s name may describe its lofty elevation or be a transfer from Mount Airy, North Carolina.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
